I have no written answer to these claims .

772
02:12:32,850 --> 02:12:37,250
Therefore , please don 't decide on the basis of these letters .

773
02:12:38,210 --> 02:12:39,720
Don 't forget that !

774
02:12:43,520 --> 02:12:47,320
Jury , before you decide the fate of the accused ...

775
02:12:48,110 --> 02:12:50,750
