799
02:15:26,250 --> 02:15:31,070
I want to get you here , where I have always loved you ...

800
02:15:32,570 --> 02:15:34,870
I have been unsuccessful and have gone back .

801
02:15:36,340 --> 02:15:38,100
I am going to be hanged ...

802
02:15:39,340 --> 02:15:41,060
