824
02:17:59,150 --> 02:18:01,960
And I don 't have to endure any other pains in the next birth .

825
02:18:03,290 --> 02:18:04,590
What are you saying ?

826
02:18:06,049 --> 02:18:09,259
Don 't argue with me . I don 't have much time .

827
02:18:10,639 --> 02:18:12,729
Answer me , yes or no ?

828
02:18:14,350 --> 02:18:18,040
Shivnath , you have tried everything to save me .

829
02:18:19,170 --> 02:18:22,090
Make one more last attempt .

830
02:18:23,070 --> 02:18:28,120
Do it today so that tomorrow , I can see from the gallows ...

831
02:18:29,219 --> 02:18:32,209
that you snatched away my Kamini from me in my interest .

832
02:18:34,010 --> 02:18:37,130
And to get her in the next birth ...

833
02:18:38,350 --> 02:18:40,180
I have intimated my fate .

834
02:18:52,780 --> 02:18:56,440
Look at me for some time ...

835
02:19:01,670 --> 02:19:03,530
I want to look at you to my heart 's content .

836
02:20:19,320 --> 02:20:23,630
We have received a letter and the contents are very dangerous .

837
02:20:24,050 --> 02:20:26,270
- What is it ? - A woman has written that ...

838
02:20:26,630 --> 02:20:29,910
she is committing suicide and ...

839
02:20:30,210 --> 02:20:32,370
