843
02:20:43,130 --> 02:20:45,470
We are trying to locate her husband .

844
02:20:46,030 --> 02:20:48,670
- What is the name of the sender ? - Ranjana .

845
02:21:10,020 --> 02:21:13,850
' Sister in law , after great difficulty ...

846
02:21:14,370 --> 02:21:15,770
I have learned his secret . '

847
02:21:16,290 --> 02:21:23,230
' I know he is not mine and can never belong to me . '

848
02:21:24,100 --> 02:21:28,630
' But I did not give up ...

849
02:21:29,620 --> 02:21:37,620
if I cannot get him here , I will get him in another world ...

850
02:21:39,560 --> 02:21:43,910
