854
02:22:00,690 --> 02:22:04,580
This letter proves that she committed suicide .

855
02:22:06,520 --> 02:22:09,400
And this is the police report regarding her signatures .

856
02:22:14,720 --> 02:22:18,870
Now you have look at them closely and decide ...

857
02:22:19,840 --> 02:22:27,840
